{"title":"Orc Raiders","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">Orcs are raiding out of their compound north of Underleaf. The watch pays for twelve. Report to Sergeant Ilsa Varne by the notice board. (Sergeant Ilsa Varne)</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><span class=\"muted\">unknown</span></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Short</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><p>Nothing to bring.</p></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to the quest-giver to get the quest.</li><li value=\"2\">Kill 12 orcs <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span></li><li value=\"3\">Report to Sergeant Ilsa Varne in Underleaf <span class=\"muted\">at -62, 206</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-62|206|Report to Sergeant Ilsa Varne in Underleaf\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>180</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>7,000</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Orc Raiders</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-orc-raiders\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-orc-raiders\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-orc-raiders\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-board-orc-raiders\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}